<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f4f4; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 30px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
    .header { background: #2563eb; color: #fff; padding: 24px; text-align: center; }
    .body { padding: 32px; color: #333; }
    .info-box { background: #eff6ff; border-left: 4px solid #2563eb; padding: 16px; border-radius: 4px; margin: 20px 0; }
    .info-row { margin: 8px 0; }
    .label { font-weight: bold; color: #555; }
    .footer { background: #f9fafb; padding: 16px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #888; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Appointment Confirmed</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Dear <strong>{{patientName}}</strong>,</p>
      <p>Your appointment has been successfully booked. Here are your details:</p>
      <div class="info-box">
        <div class="info-row"><span class="label">Doctor:</span> Dr. {{doctorName}}</div>
        <div class="info-row"><span class="label">Specialization:</span> {{specialization}}</div>
        <div class="info-row"><span class="label">Date:</span> {{date}}</div>
        <div class="info-row"><span class="label">Time:</span> {{timeSlot}}</div>
        <div class="info-row"><span class="label">Consultation Fee:</span> ৳{{consultationFee}}</div>
      </div>
      <p>To cancel your appointment, please contact us or use the patient portal.</p>
      <p>Thank you for choosing our clinic!</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">© 2025 Clinic Management System | This is an automated email</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>